            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Hello! I'm Kurt!\nI specialise in turning Apricorns into Pok\u00e9 Balls.\nIf you like, I can convert one of yours into a Pok\u00e9\nBall.\nHello again.\nDo you have an Apricorn for me?\nWhich Apricorn would you like me to convert?\nLet me know when you want me to convert an\nApricorn for you.\nOkay. I'll turn your  into a Pok\u00e9 Ball for you.\nI should be finished by tomorrow.\nCome back when you have an Apricorn for me."
